<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>AYDIN AUTO</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>

*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;
}

body{
background:#050505;
color:white;
overflow-x:hidden;
}

header{
height:100vh;
background:
linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,.6),rgba(0,0,0,.85)),
url('1E77547B-A49D-4769-8CE2-CE3C2ECC6960.jpeg');
background-size:cover;
background-position:center;
display:flex;
align-items:center;
justify-content:center;
text-align:center;
padding:20px;
}

.hero h1{
font-size:80px;
letter-spacing:6px;
font-weight:700;
}

.hero p{
margin-top:15px;
font-size:24px;
color:#ddd;
}

.hero a{
display:inline-block;
margin-top:35px;
padding:16px 45px;
background:#d4af37;
color:black;
text-decoration:none;
font-weight:600;
border-radius:14px;
}

.section-title{
text-align:center;
font-size:48px;
margin:80px 0 40px;
}

.car{
position:relative;
height:90vh;
overflow:hidden;
}

.car img{
width:100%;
height:100%;
object-fit:cover;
filter:brightness(.65);
}

.overlay{
position:absolute;
bottom:60px;
left:60px;
}

.overlay h2{
font-size:55px;
margin-bottom:10px;
}

.overlay p{
font-size:22px;
color:#ddd;
max-width:600px;
line-height:1.7;
}

.branches{
padding:80px 20px;
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));
gap:25px;
max-width:1200px;
margin:auto;
}

.branch{
background:#111;
padding:40px;
border-radius:25px;
text-align:center;
border:1px solid #222;
}

.branch h3{
font-size:32px;
margin-bottom:12px;
color:#d4af37;
}

.branch p{
color:#aaa;
font-size:18px;
}

footer{
padding:60px 20px;
text-align:center;
background:#0a0a0a;
border-top:1px solid #1d1d1d;
}

footer h2{
font-size:38px;
margin-bottom:15px;
}

footer p{
color:#888;
}

</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>

<div class="hero">

<h1>AYDIN AUTO</h1>

<p>Premium Otomobil Deneyimi</p>

<a href="https://instagram.com/aydinautoresmi">
Instagram
</a>

</div>

</header>

<h2 class="section-title">Öne Çıkan Araçlarımız</h2>

<section class="car">

<img src="062B7BCA-316E-49EE-AC93-179B9EC6AC71.png">

<div class="overlay">
<h2>PORSCHE CAYANNE</h2>
<p>Üst düzey konfor, premium detaylar ve güçlü duruş.</p>
</div>

</section>

<section class="car">

<img src="35C20A1F-C4C5-4C2D-AE1C-BB8B82E47414.png">

<div class="overlay">
<h2>Mercedes G63 AMG</h2>
<p>Agresif tasarım ve gerçek AMG ruhu.</p>
</div>

</section>

<section class="car">

<img src="73134C2B-05A4-4A36-B23E-8AD0646CA75F.png">

<div class="overlay">
<h2>Ferrari 488 GTB</h2>
<p>İtalyan mühendisliği ve saf performans.</p>
</div>

</section>

<section class="car">

<img src="8785FCE8-273D-499B-B370-3481D5DAC245.png">

<div class="overlay">
<h2>Range Rover</h2>
<p>Lüks SUV deneyimi ve modern çizgiler.</p>
</div>

</section>

<section class="car">

<img src="AC1DB475-2A48-44E2-A6B7-4F771D0225FE.png">

<div class="overlay">
<h2>Lamborghini Urus</h2>
<p>Sportif SUV dünyasının zirvesi.</p>
</div>

</section>

<h2 class="section-title">Şubelerimiz</h2>

<section class="branches">

<div class="branch">
<h3>Esenyurt</h3>
<p>Merkez Şube</p>
</div>

<div class="branch">
<h3>Florya</h3>
<p>2. Şube</p>
</div>

<div class="branch">
<h3>Çorlu</h3>
<p>3. Şube</p>
</div>

</section>

<footer>

<h2>AYDIN AUTO</h2>

<p>Sıfır & 2. El Premium Otomobiller</p>

</footer>

</body>
</html>